indicators.unit:
FEV₁ and FVC: litres (L);
FEV₁/FVC: percentage (%);
PEF: L/min (if measured).

indicators.prevention_and_actions:
Maintain cabin air filtration and ventilation; monitor cabin air quality and carbon dioxide levels;
minimize exposure to dust and airborne contaminants;
use appropriate respiratory protection during surface activities;
maintain regular physical exercise;
report respiratory symptoms early;
perform scheduled pulmonary function assessments and compare results with individual baseline values.
